# Oscilinea release configuration (optional overrides)
#
# Copy this file to scripts/release.config and uncomment lines only if the
# automatic keychain detection in scripts/release.sh picks the wrong identity.
# In the normal case you do NOT need this file at all -- the script finds your
# Developer ID certificates and notarization profile on its own.
#
# scripts/release.config is gitignored: it must never be committed.

# Full certificate names, exactly as shown by:
#   security find-identity -v            (for the Installer cert)
#   security find-identity -v -p codesigning   (for the Application cert)
# Distribution uses your paid team 8GPYZ947VY (not the personal team J2BHY3YDKL).
# DEV_ID_APP="Developer ID Application: Jorge Hazael Anaya (8GPYZ947VY)"
# DEV_ID_INSTALLER="Developer ID Installer: Jorge Hazael Anaya (8GPYZ947VY)"

# Name of the notarization credential profile stored in your keychain via
#   xcrun notarytool store-credentials <name> ...
# NOTARY_PROFILE="oscilinea-notary"
